            "description": "# linfengxu/CoSAG-nf\n\nCoSAG-nf is a Nextflow pipeline for high-throughput single-cell amplified genome (SAG) co-assembly: individual SPAdes assembly, Sourmash MinHash clustering, hierarchical clustering, iterative co-assembly, optional TNF-based SAG subset optimization, GTDB-Tk classification, and an interactive HTML report (`cosag_report.html`).\n\n**Repository:** https://github.com/linfengxu/CoSAG-nf  \n**Documentation:** https://github.com/linfengxu/CoSAG-nf/tree/main/docs  \n**Parameters:** `nextflow_schema.json` and `docs/usage.md`",
